    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have mastered the art of using Yuuzhan Vong <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown_Weapons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown Weapons\">Thrown Weapons</a> and can cause them to return to your hand.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Simple_Weapons)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)\">Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you miss with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Razor_Bug\" title=\"Razor Bug\">Razor Bug</a> or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thud_Bug\" title=\"Thud Bug\">Thud Bug</a>, the weapon returns to your hand immediately.</p>",
